        <description>In Central Park on West Drive, in line with W 67th St which is just outside (west of) the park; even with the northern edge of LP W6702 which is located on the cobblestone curb island on the east side of West Drive. LP W6702 is directly across from (east of) the center of the entry/exit driveway which runs between West Drive and Tavern on the Green and serves as the access route between West Drive and Central Park West at 67th St. 40.77257, -73.97676</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1500-1A237E</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -73.976768,40.772576,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
